d><code>51.132.44.192/29</code></td><td><code>51.132.44.192</code> - <code>51.132.44.199</code></td></tr><tr><td>EU</td><td>westeurope (Netherlands)<br/>Default region</td><td><code>20.31.74.16/29</code></td><td><code>20.31.74.16</code> - <code>20.31.74.23</code></td></tr><tr><td>EU</td><td>germanywestcentral (Frankfurt)</td><td><code>20.79.135.80/29</code></td><td><code>20.79.135.80</code> - <code>20.79.135.87</code></td></tr><tr><td>Middle East</td><td>uaenorth (Dubai)<br/>Default region</td><td><code>20.233.73.80/29</code></td><td><code>20.233.73.80</code> - <code>20.233.73.87</code></td></tr><tr><td>Singapore</td><td>southeastasia (Singapore)</td><td><code>104.43.99.136/29</code></td><td><code>104.43.99.136</code> - <code>104.43.99.143</code></td></tr><tr><td>Japan</td><td>japaneast (Tokyo)</td><td><code>52.155.112.248/29</code></td><td><code>52.155.112.248</code> - <code>52.155.112.255</code></td></tr><tr><td>India</td><td>centralindia (Pune)</td><td><code>20.235.195.248/29</code></td><td><code>20.235.195.249</code> - <code>20.235.195.254</code></td></tr><tr><td>Switzerland</td><td>switzerlandnorth (Zurich)</td><td><code>74.161.48.104/29</code></td><td><code>74.161.48.105</code> - <code>74.161.48.110</code></td></tr><tr><td>South Korea</td><td>koreacentral (Seoul)</td><td><code>20.196.249.184/29</code></td><td><code>20.196.249.184</code> - <code>20.196.249.191</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>If we are missing a region that you need, <a href="https://support.fivetran.com/hc/en-us/requests/new">contact our support team</a>.</p><h2 id="webhooksusers">Webhooks users<a href="#webhooksusers" class="deep-link" aria-label="Copy link to the clipboard" data-state="closed"><span class="Icon_iconWrapper__6VYeo Icon_inlineBlock__4gX4e Icon_containerSizeInherit__TgSkD HeadingLink_linkIcon__27TFB"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="far" data-icon="link-simple" class="svg-inline--fa fa-link-simple Icon_icon__NjPQR Icon_iconSizeInherit__Sv9CE" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 256C0 167.6 71.6 96 160 96h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C98.1 144 48 194.1 48 256s50.1 112 112 112h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C71.6 416 0 344.4 0 256zm576 0c0 88.4-71.6 160-160 160H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c61.9 0 112-50.1 112-112s-50.1-112-112-112H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c88.4 0 160 71.6 160 160zM184 232H392c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H184c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24z"></path></svg></span></a></h2><p>If you want to authenticate webhooks through IP, safelist the following IP addresses in your firewall.</p><div class="Table_table__q_cRx"><table><thead><tr><th>IP Addresses (CIDR)</th><th>IP Addresses (Range)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>34.85.252.27/32</code></td><td><code>34.85.252.27</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>35.197.105.90/32</code></td><td><code>35.197.105.90</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>136.107.62.136/29</code></td><td><code>136.107.62.136 - 136.107.62.143</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>136.118.115.24/29</code></td><td><code>136.118.115.24 - 136.118.115.31</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Fivetran validates the URL of your webhook-receiving endpoint and sends webhook events from these IP addresses.</p><h2 id="fivetranproxyusers">Fivetran Proxy users<a href="#fivetranproxyusers" class="deep-link" aria-label="Copy link to the clipboard" data-state="closed"><span class="Icon_iconWrapper__6VYeo Icon_inlineBlock__4gX4e Icon_containerSizeInherit__TgSkD HeadingLink_linkIcon__27TFB"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="far" data-icon="link-simple" class="svg-inline--fa fa-link-simple Icon_icon__NjPQR Icon_iconSizeInherit__Sv9CE" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 256C0 167.6 71.6 96 160 96h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C98.1 144 48 194.1 48 256s50.1 112 112 112h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C71.6 416 0 344.4 0 256zm576 0c0 88.4-71.6 160-160 160H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c61.9 0 112-50.1 112-112s-50.1-112-112-112H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c88.4 0 160 71.6 160 160zM184 232H392c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H184c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24z"></path></svg></span></a></h2><p>Fivetran Proxy uses a wildcard domain to route traffic through our proxy servers. Your connection to Fivetran Proxy may communicate with any subdomain of the <a href="#allprovidersandregions">following wildcard domains</a>. Each wildcard domain resolves to a set of IP addresses that may change over time.</p><h3 id="configureyourfirewallortrafficfilteringdevice">Configure your firewall or traffic filtering device<a href="#configureyourfirewallortrafficfilteringdevice" class="deep-link" aria-label="Copy link to the clipboard" data-state="closed"><span class="Icon_iconWrapper__6VYeo Icon_inlineBlock__4gX4e Icon_containerSizeInherit__TgSkD HeadingLink_linkIcon__27TFB"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="far" data-icon="link-simple" class="svg-inline--fa fa-link-simple Icon_icon__NjPQR Icon_iconSizeInherit__Sv9CE" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 256C0 167.6 71.6 96 160 96h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C98.1 144 48 194.1 48 256s50.1 112 112 112h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C71.6 416 0 344.4 0 256zm576 0c0 88.4-71.6 160-160 160H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c61.9 0 112-50.1 112-112s-50.1-112-112-112H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c88.4 0 160 71.6 160 160zM184 232H392c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H184c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24z"></path></svg></span></a></h3><p>If your firewall or traffic filtering device supports restricting traffic by domain or hostname, add the <a href="#allprovidersandregions">following domains</a> to your safelist.</p><p>If your firewall or traffic filtering device does <em>not</em> support restricting traffic by domain or hostname, resolve the current IP addresses of the <a href="#allprovidersandregions">following domains</a> and add them to your safelist. The IP addresses may change in the future without notice.</p><h3 id="allprovidersandregions">All providers and regions<a href="#allprovidersandregions" class="deep-link" aria-label="Copy link to the clipboard" data-state="closed"><span class="Icon_iconWrapper__6VYeo Icon_inlineBlock__4gX4e Icon_containerSizeInherit__TgSkD HeadingLink_linkIcon__27TFB"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="far" data-icon="link-simple" class="svg-inline--fa fa-link-simple Icon_icon__NjPQR Icon_iconSizeInherit__Sv9CE" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 256C0 167.6 71.6 96 160 96h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C98.1 144 48 194.1 48 256s50.1 112 112 112h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C71.6 416 0 344.4 0 256zm576 0c0 88.4-71.6 160-160 160H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c61.9 0 112-50.1 112-112s-50.1-112-112-112H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c88.4 0 160 71.6 160 160zM184 232H392c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H184c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24z"></path></svg></span></a></h3><p>For every provider and region, you must safelist the following domain:</p><div class="Table_table__q_cRx"><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Hostname</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Proxy Broker</td><td><code>orchestrator.fivetran.com</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Next, safelist the domains required for your cloud service provider:</p><h3 id="googlecloudplatform_1">Google Cloud Platform<a href="#googlecloudplatform_1" class="deep-link" aria-label="Copy link to the clipboard" data-state="closed"><span class="Icon_iconWrapper__6VYeo Icon_inlineBlock__4gX4e Icon_containerSizeInherit__TgSkD HeadingLink_linkIcon__27TFB"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="far" data-icon="link-simple" class="svg-inline--fa fa-link-simple Icon_icon__NjPQR Icon_iconSizeInherit__Sv9CE" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 256C0 167.6 71.6 96 160 96h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C98.1 144 48 194.1 48 256s50.1 112 112 112h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C71.6 416 0 344.4 0 256zm576 0c0 88.4-71.6 160-160 160H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c61.9 0 112-50.1 112-112s-50.1-112-112-112H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c88.4 0 160 71.6 160 160zM184 232H392c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H184c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24z"></path></svg></span></a></h3><div class="Table_table__q_cRx"><table><thead><tr><th>Geography</th><th>Region</th><th>Hostname</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>US</td><td>us-east4 (N. Virginia)</td><td><code>*.us-east4.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>US</td><td>us-west1 (Oregon)</td><td><code>*.us-west1.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>US</td><td>us-central1 (Iowa)</td><td><code>*.us-central1.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>EU</td><td>europe-west3 (Frankfurt)</td><td><code>*.europe-west3.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>Australia</td><td>australia-southeast-1 (Sydney)</td><td><code>*.australia-southeast1.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>UK</td><td>europe-west2 (London)</td><td><code>*.europe-west2.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>Canada</td><td>northamerica-northeast1 (Montréal)</td><td><code>*.northamerica-northeast1.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>Singapore</td><td>asia-southeast1  (Singapore)</td><td><code>*.asia-southeast1.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>India</td><td>asia-south1 (Mumbai)</td><td><code>*.asia-south1.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>Japan</td><td>asia-northeast1 (Tokyo)</td><td><code>*.asia-northeast1.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>Indonesia</td><td>asia-southeast2 (Jakarta)</td><td><code>*.asia-southeast2.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id="aws_1">AWS<a href="#aws_1" class="deep-link" aria-label="Copy link to the clipboard" data-state="closed"><span class="Icon_iconWrapper__6VYeo Icon_inlineBlock__4gX4e Icon_containerSizeInherit__TgSkD HeadingLink_linkIcon__27TFB"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="far" data-icon="link-simple" class="svg-inline--fa fa-link-simple Icon_icon__NjPQR Icon_iconSizeInherit__Sv9CE" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 256C0 167.6 71.6 96 160 96h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C98.1 144 48 194.1 48 256s50.1 112 112 112h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C71.6 416 0 344.4 0 256zm576 0c0 88.4-71.6 160-160 160H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c61.9 0 112-50.1 112-112s-50.1-112-112-112H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c88.4 0 160 71.6 160 160zM184 232H392c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H184c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24z"></path></svg></span></a></h3><div class="Table_table__q_cRx"><table><thead><tr><th>Geography</th><th>Region</th><th>Hostname</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>US</td><td>us-east-1 (N. Virginia)</td><td><code>*.us-east-1.aws.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>US</td><td>us-east-2 (Ohio)</td><td><code>*.us-east-2.aws.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>US</td><td>us-west-2 (Oregon)</td><td><code>*.us-west-2.aws.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>US</td><td>us-gov-west-1 (GovCloud US West)</td><td><code>*.us-gov-west-1.aws.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>Canada</td><td>ca-central-1 (Montréal)</td><td><code>*.ca-central-1.aws.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>EU</td><td>eu-west-1 (Dublin)</td><td><code>*.eu-west-1.aws.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>EU</td><td>eu-central-1 (Frankfurt)</td><td><c