 IhBPp x9Sy3 pCfKE EnULL Qx8gs" style="--ptxUv:flex;--rFClu:column;--wfhac:auto;--pcmDX:289px;--nloFG:flex-start"><a href="https://www.fivetran.com" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="Anchor_anchor__GZmYs Anchor_primary__SriBt" data-erd-link="true"><img alt="Fivetran" loading="lazy" width="112" height="32" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/static-assets-docs/_next/static/media/fivetran-caption.1f6091e9.svg"/></a></div><div class="vGoed SrMS1 SsL0a _3vVBt EnULL" style="--ptxUv:flex;--uk6o_:flex-start;--GshZd:1;--nloFG:center"><span class="LhogN etjCR D2O_z AFd3p P8D15 w85BD" style="--yUSV0:border-box;--mp3i3:0px">©2026 Fivetran Inc.</span></div></div></div></footer></div></div></div></div></div><noscript><iframe src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-W5ZRDW88" height="0" width="0" style="display:none;visibility:hidden"></iframe></noscript></div><script id="__NEXT_DATA__" type="application/json">{"props":{"pageProps":{"article":{"path":"/docs/security-and-privacy/ips","githubUrl":"https://github.com/fivetran/engineering/blob/main/docs/security-and-privacy/ips/index.md","meta":{"name":"Fivetran IPs","title":"How Fivetran connects | Fivetran Fixed IP Addresses","description":"Learn about the fixed IP ranges of Fivetran system. Review the system IP addresses and understand how we connect to sources and destinations."},"content":"[{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"GithubButton\",\"attributes\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/fivetran/engineering/blob/main/docs/security-and-privacy/ips/index.md\"},\"children\":[]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"h1\",\"attributes\":{\"id\":\"fivetranipaddresses\"},\"children\":[\"Fivetran IP Addresses\",{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"HeadingLink\",\"attributes\":{\"id\":\"fivetranipaddresses\",\"isFaqPage\":false},\"children\":[]}]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"p\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[\"We pull data from your sources and send it to your destination using a set of fixed IP addresses. To ensure that Fivetran can do this, you must safelist these IP addresses in your firewall. Use the following list to safelist all IPs listed for your selected \",{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"a\",\"attributes\":{\"href\":\"/docs/security-and-privacy/privacy#fivetrandataresidency\"},\"children\":[\"cloud service provider and the region\"]},\" in which you'd like your Fivetran connections to run. Fivetran supports the following cloud service providers:\"]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"ul\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"li\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"a\",\"attributes\":{\"href\":\"/docs/security-and-privacy/ips#googlecloudplatform\"},\"children\":[\"Google Cloud Platform\"]}]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"li\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"a\",\"attributes\":{\"href\":\"/docs/security-and-privacy/ips#aws\"},\"children\":[\"AWS\"]}]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"li\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"a\",\"attributes\":{\"href\":\"/docs/security-and-privacy/ips#azure\"},\"children\":[\"Azure\"]}]}]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"Important\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"p\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[\"Google Cloud Platform is the default cloud service provider. Google Cloud Platform is your only cloud service provider if you're on a \",{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"a\",\"attributes\":{\"href\":\"https://www.fivetran.com/pricing/features\"},\"children\":[\"Standard or Free plan\"]},\". You can select a different cloud service provider if you are on an \",{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"a\",\"attributes\":{\"href\":\"/docs/security-and-privacy/privacy#fivetrandataresidency\"},\"children\":[\"Enterprise or Business Critical plan\"]},\".\"]}]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"p\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[\"To see your current data processing location (geography), cloud service provider, and region, go to the Connection Details section of the \",{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"strong\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[\"Destination\"]},\" page in your Fivetran dashboard:\"]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"p\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"Image\",\"attributes\":{\"src\":\"docsMedia380547823\",\"alt\":\"Destination's Connection Details shows cloud provider and region\"},\"children\":[]}]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"h2\",\"attributes\":{\"id\":\"googlecloudplatform\"},\"children\":[\"Google Cloud Platform\",{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"HeadingLink\",\"attributes\":{\"id\":\"googlecloudplatform\",\"isFaqPage\":false},\"children\":[]}]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"Table\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"thead\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"tr\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"th\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[\"Geography\"]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"th\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[\"Region\"]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"th\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[\"IP Addresses (CIDR)\"]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"th\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[\"IP Addresses (Range)\"]}]}]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"tbody\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"tr\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"td\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[\"US\"]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"td\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[\"us-east4 (N. Virginia)\",{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"br\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[]},\"Default region\"]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"td\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"InlineCode\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[\"35.234.176.144/29\"]}]},{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"td\",\"attributes\":{},\"children\":[{\"$$mdtype\":\"Tag\",\"name\":\"I